Will GEO help me rank better in traditional search engines like Google?

It absolutely can, but it’s not guaranteed. GEO and [SEO](https://www.perrill.com/minneapolis-seo-agency/) often work hand-in-hand. At least they should. While GEO primarily targets AI-driven platforms, it can also support your website's visibility in Google search as well as across AI outputs and traditional results. Strategies like producing fresh, user-centric content and leveraging semantic optimization contribute to improved search performance overall. By making your digital assets more relevant, discoverable, and engaging, you can experience a lift across multiple channels.



How quickly can I see results from a GEO campaign?

Timelines vary depending on your current online presence, the competitiveness of your market, and the agility of AI-driven search platforms. Often, you’ll notice initial shifts within a few weeks, such as higher placement in select results or increased engagement. However, true, sustainable visibility can take a few months of refinement and iterative updates. At Perrill, we believe in consistent monitoring and adjustments to ensure that your progress remains steady and meaningful over time. We’ve seen brands achieve top mentions in ChatGPT within 2 weeks of starting GEO services.



