GEO is versatile and can benefit brands in virtually any sector, from B2B tech, third-party logistics, for-profit universities, to consumer retail. AI-driven engines aim to serve the most relevant and authoritative information to users, which means companies of all sizes can gain an edge with the right optimization strategy. Even niche industries can reap benefits by positioning their products and services accurately for AI-generated queries. Essentially, if your business relies on being discovered online, GEO is a powerful tool.



